1.ASIB IDs 
==========

                               __________________
Global IDs are of the form :- | VID | SIID | IID |
                               ------------------

Global ID width:- 8
Padding width:- 6
VID width:- 5
SIID width:- 2
IID width:- 0

ID values are in binary; x's are used to denote those bits filled
with the VID for that particular ASIB.

ASIB Name                      | SIID  | IID   | ID         
-------------------------------------------------------------
sSpi                           | 0     | 0     | 8'b0000xx00
sD2dData                       | 2     | 0     | 8'b0xxxxx10
sIrisBridge                    | 1     | 0     | 8'b0xxxxx01

