12.IO (ASIBs to AMIBs) Connectivity Paths with 
  (Outstanding,Issuing and Acceptance)Transactions details- Information 
========================================================================

This provides detailed information on the connectivity of ASIB to AMIB and ASIB to GPV 
with regards to their input / output ports. IB, TLX and VNB blocks are also traversed 
and included in the path. 

Along with connectivity details following details are also provided :
Note: For ASIB 'Read Ac./Is.' is read issuing, 'Write Ac./Is.' is 'Write Issuing' and 'Total Iss.' is total issuing transactions.
Note: For AMIB 'Read Ac./Is.' is read acceptance, 'Write Iss' is write acceptance and 'Total Trans' is total acceptance Transactions
Note: For Other Blocks 'Read Ac./Is.' is 'Outstanding Read','Write Ac./Is.' is 'Outstanding Write' and 'Total Trans' is total outstanding transactions


